{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO HELL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devilish, unfair, and damn funny \u2013 that's Hell Games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fallen Olympians, former tricksters, and doping offenders are now battling it out in the deepest pits of hell. Here, 1-4 players engage in an infernal player vs player competition. Grab weapons and upgrades to take down your opponents - and always watch out for the lava. May the most ruthless prevail! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554970/extras/7f3d4e9e3882a1fea85e69a95320fba2.poster.avif?t=1771019029\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554970/extras/7f3d4e9e3882a1fea85e69a95320fba2.webm?t=1771019029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554970/extras/7f3d4e9e3882a1fea85e69a95320fba2.mp4?t=1771019029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEAT \u2018EM UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against friends or bots in your own realm, or jump into online mode to go head-to-head with fellow Steam players! The main thing is, make sure you end up with that well-deserved victory crown in your hands!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554970/extras/42d58a761bf3e125013a5e3b3d37f9f5.poster.avif?t=1771019029\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554970/extras/42d58a761bf3e125013a5e3b3d37f9f5.webm?t=1771019029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554970/extras/42d58a761bf3e125013a5e3b3d37f9f5.mp4?t=1771019029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STAY UNFAIR </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In hell, doping isn't just allowed, it's mandatory! With a whopping 11 different power-ups, you'll be boosted to an unbeatable force. Stronger, bigger, faster - maybe even invisible. Grab them quickly before your opponents get a chance! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554970/extras/8cfe5d81740bbbd6331259bfbb7064f9.poster.avif?t=1771019029\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554970/extras/8cfe5d81740bbbd6331259bfbb7064f9.webm?t=1771019029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554970/extras/8cfe5d81740bbbd6331259bfbb7064f9.mp4?t=1771019029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT LIKE AN ATHLETE </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Athletes aren't allowed to carry knives? No problem! In hell, sports equipment gets a whole new purpose. With a discus, spear, or hammer, you'll knock your competition out of the ring. There are a bunch of different sports tools waiting for you to masterfully wield! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2554970/extras/e2889c241723830b543e8b86667ac4ac.avif?t=1771019029\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CRAFT YOUR CHAMPION </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your athlete's physique and style, then dive into the arena. Command with precision using mouse and keyboard, or wield a gaming controller for ultimate control. Not feeling the setup? Remix it to match your vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragrap